ed}&\\int \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\ln\\left|\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e870431c-92bb-5f3f-b624-c50b90330905" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e870431c-92bb-5f3f-b624-c50b90330905" :question/answer-fields "0346dcae-d2e2-555f-9119-50212978c12e"] [:db/ensure "e870431c-92bb-5f3f-b624-c50b90330905" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "e870431c-92bb-5f3f-b624-c50b90330905"] [:db/add "8fed5563-4172-5034-93a0-7459119c0e98" :answer/id #uuid "8fed5563-4172-5034-93a0-7459119c0e98"] [:db/add "8fed5563-4172-5034-93a0-7459119c0e98" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8fed5563-4172-5034-93a0-7459119c0e98" :answer/value "6 \\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|+C"] [:db/ensure "8fed5563-4172-5034-93a0-7459119c0e98" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3fba4528-f0a3-544c-a9fb-818bac137805" :answer/id #uuid "3fba4528-f0a3-544c-a9fb-818bac137805"] [:db/add "3fba4528-f0a3-544c-a9fb-818bac137805" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3fba4528-f0a3-544c-a9fb-818bac137805" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "3fba4528-f0a3-544c-a9fb-818bac137805" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c4fc6c13-e454-5335-b149-5b860cafcc74" :answer/id #uuid "c4fc6c13-e454-5335-b149-5b860cafcc74"] [:db/add "c4fc6c13-e454-5335-b149-5b860cafcc74" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c4fc6c13-e454-5335-b149-5b860cafcc74" :answer/value "\\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|+C"] [:db/ensure "c4fc6c13-e454-5335-b149-5b860cafcc74" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2f1ab629-f4b2-5f36-96d8-